Description:
    Generates a ViewComponent in the Sidecar Pattern Extended layout: the
    class, its template, its Lookbook preview and one preview example, plus
    the component spec. Pass the component name (CamelCased or under_scored)
    and an optional list of options the component takes.

    There is no `_component` suffix on the directory or the class, and no
    `_preview` suffix on the preview — the class is `Component` inside a
    namespace module.

Example:
    bin/rails generate business_logic:view_component Listings::Card listing

    This will create:
        app/components/listings/card/component.rb        # Listings::Card::Component
        app/components/listings/card/component.html.erb
        app/components/listings/card/preview.rb          # Listings::Card::Preview
        app/components/listings/card/preview/default.html.erb
        spec/components/listings/card/component_spec.rb

Options:
    --skip-preview   Do not generate the preview and its example template.
    --skip-test      Do not generate the component spec.
